# This tree has deliberately mixed line endings: LLMS.md, README.md and
# docs/changelog.md are CRLF, every other document and all Python is LF.
# That is intentional and the test suite checks it, so git must not normalise
# anything. `-text` disables end-of-line conversion in both directions, so a
# checkout is byte-identical to what was committed.
* -text
